{"v":4,"catch":"拯救國王！","desc":"《KING & BALLOON》是 NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.）於 1980 年發行的射擊遊戲。\n擊落前來偷走國王的成群氣球！\n只要國王沒有完全被帶入天空，遊戲就會繼續，無論你的大砲被摧毀多少次。\n您還可以在氣球帶走國王時將其擊落並在他離開之前將其救出。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-07-20","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cb596726c184df2f9cc102ecc083b07ac52a8bd7a28d905d0c580fe137e3830c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/01aa6cc53804cca44e9f9337cbe9f5da76f682390a709116b7f28114df404957.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6b0e2732513a1448eb63cda247dc4f89ea34209da25e2de0ae64e6b2802f0449.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0f10f1c6787ba84f97ab4b088251164d3d52737e5c923237884c39c1f25a483c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5137708406da44e0d44d3d6bb977bcc67dc45b0769540ed3f5beba06083b456b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/523a602a4d2f7cc122aa5c5e42001b350819f5e91b73b66d33345d9c59b172c7.jpg"],"titleId":"0100d0001a6a2000","dlc":[]}